SPARTA (24 Sep 2025)
Running on 4 MPI task(s)
################################################################################
# thermal argon gas in a closed 3d box with fix ave/histo/weight
#
# Regression coverage for fix ave/histo/weight (fix_ave_histo_weight.cpp), which
# had no working configuration before: histogramming a per-grid compute weighted
# by another per-grid compute segfaulted because post-process grid computes
# (e.g. compute grid) never allocate array_grid.  Here the per-cell temperature
# is histogrammed, weighted by the per-cell particle count.
#
# Note:
#  - The "comm/sort" option to the "global" command is used to match MPI runs.
#  - The "twopass" option is used to match Kokkos runs.
# The "comm/sort" and "twopass" options should not be used for production runs.
################################################################################

seed	    	    12345
dimension   	    3
global              gridcut 1.0e-5 comm/sort yes

boundary	    rr rr rr

create_box  	    0 0.0001 0 0.0001 0 0.0001
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (0.0001 0.0001 0.0001)
create_grid 	    10 10 10
WARNING: Could not acquire nearby ghost cells b/c grid partition is not clumped (/home/user/sparta/src/grid.cpp:473)
Created 1000 child grid cells
  CPU time = 0.00133602 secs
  create/ghost percent = 92.5772 7.42277
balance_grid        rcb part
Balance grid migrated 740 cells
  CPU time = 0.00100189 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 53.5844 0.273483 16.191 29.9512

species		    ar.species Ar
mixture		    air Ar vstream 0.0 0.0 0.0 temp 273.15

global              nrho 7.07043E22
global              fnum 7.07043E6

collide		    vss air ar.vss
create_particles    air n 10000 twopass
Created 10000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00201415 secs

# histogram per-cell temperature, weighted by per-cell particle count
compute             gt grid all air temp
compute             gn grid all air n
fix                 hw ave/histo/weight 10 5 100 0 600 20 c_gt[1] c_gn[1] mode vector

compute             temp temp
stats		    100
stats_style	    step cpu np ncoll c_temp f_hw[1] f_hw[2]

timestep 	    7.00E-9
run 		    500
